---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="How To Live Better">
  <main style="padding: 2rem 1.5rem; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <header style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-comic); font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--color-jade); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        How To Live Better
      </h1>
      <p style="color: var(--theme-text-muted); font-size: 1.05rem;">
        Spend the least money, time and effort to get back the most lifespan, money and personal freedom.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="liquid-glass" style="padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        <span class="comic-sticker sticker-benefit">ROI: Very High</span>
        <span class="comic-sticker sticker-neutral">Evidence: Grade A</span>
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        Daily Quick Win: Household Potassium Salt
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--theme-text);">
        In plain words: In a 20,000-person study, swapping regular salt for potassium-enriched salt cut stroke risk by 14% and death by 12% over 5 years.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
